[5.355106, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.36646, "o", "transport path (chain 127.0.0.1:1082)\r\n  reachable         yes\r\n  known-open        open      reply 0x00         3.0ms\r\n  known-closed      closed    reply 0x05         2.1ms\r\n  blackholed        error     reply 0x01         1.3ms   <- expected filtered\r\n\r\n  fidelity          full\r\n  This proxy reports refused connections distinctly (0x05), so scanr can\r\n  tell `closed` apart from `filtered` in your results.\r\n\r\n  a chain's fidelity is its exit hop's; record it on that transport,\r\n                   not on the chain itself.\r\n"]
[7.868406, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2;36m# A pool spreads probes across dante and exit-b by hash of the endpoint, so a\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.269819, "o", "\u001b[2;36m# rerun goes the same way. Every result names its member.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
