[15.5352, "o", "\u001b[1;36mOverview\u001b[0m\r\nscan            \u001b[1mlab-audit\u001b[0m\r\ntransport       spread (pool of 2 across dante, exit-b)  fidelity \u001b[32mfull\u001b[0m\r\nscope           5 probes (1 targets x 5 ports)\r\ntiming          concurrency 512, rate 400/s, connect_timeout 5s\r\nscan id         bef91a42  \u001b[2mseed c27974c9ced5543c\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36mResults\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mendpoint             state     service               rtt  banner / tls\u001b[0m\r\n"]
